        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a two-person team. Join our &quot;World Observatory&quot; QQ Group to chat with us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group Number:935818626</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Synopsis</strong> <br>&lt;FUSHA2  Nocturnal Fishing<i>&gt;</i> is a horror adventure game that delivers a breakneck pace and rich content. Utilizing realistic 3D environments, over fifty haunting hand-drawn CGs, and a refined 20,000-word script, it cuts out all tedious exposition to immerse you in the terror of being alone in an unfamiliar and dire situation, facing an escalating survival crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: This is a pure text-based novel game with no action sequences.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105570/extras/45f6dd1b23a621c71fae04526157b14f.avif?t=1764030755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105570/extras_big/45f6dd1b23a621c71fae04526157b14f.webp?t=1764030755 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Narrative &amp; Endings</strong> <br>Venturing alone to a secluded river bend at night, hoping for a big catch, your every casual choice will steer the story in different directions. Encounter unforeseen events and discover over twenty different endings. Among them, only one path leads to survival. Will you be lucky enough to make the right choices?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105570/extras/62ee92178476288cc319d202dbdb6351.avif?t=1764030755\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Jumpscares</strong> <br>Tired of sudden loud noises and things popping into your face? Rest assured, this game avoids such heart-stopping tactics.&lt;FUSHA2  Nocturnal Fishing<i>&gt; </i>is more like a classic horror film. It never relies on cheap jumpscares, yet masterfully maintains a deeply unsettling atmosphere that sends chills down your spine, fully committing to an immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105570/extras/8d3c39beeca2c523c2b1811c7439ffd0.avif?t=1764030755\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future Plans</strong> <br>While &lt;FUSHA2  Nocturnal Fishing<i>&gt;</i> is a complete story in itself, it also serves as the second chapter in the planned six-part &lt;<i>FUSHAS&gt;</i> saga. The hidden threads connecting the larger narrative are gradually being revealed. In future installments, we will continue to deliver uniquely styled horror stories, each offering a distinctively different experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recommendation</strong> <br>Ideal for players who enjoy text-based novels or horror, seeking a casual yet thrilling experience. Also makes for a unique gift for friends!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a two-person team. Join our &quot;World Observatory&quot; QQ Group to chat with us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group Number:935818626</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Synopsis</strong> <br>&lt;FUSHA2  Nocturnal Fishing<i>&gt;</i> is a horror adventure game that delivers a breakneck pace and rich content. Utilizing realistic 3D environments, over fifty haunting hand-drawn CGs, and a refined 20,000-word script, it cuts out all tedious exposition to immerse you in the terror of being alone in an unfamiliar and dire situation, facing an escalating survival crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: This is a pure text-based novel game with no action sequences.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105570/extras/45f6dd1b23a621c71fae04526157b14f.avif?t=1764030755\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105570/extras_big/45f6dd1b23a621c71fae04526157b14f.webp?t=1764030755 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Narrative &amp; Endings</strong> <br>Venturing alone to a secluded river bend at night, hoping for a big catch, your every casual choice will steer the story in different directions. Encounter unforeseen events and discover over twenty different endings. Among them, only one path leads to survival. Will you be lucky enough to make the right choices?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105570/extras/62ee92178476288cc319d202dbdb6351.avif?t=1764030755\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Jumpscares</strong> <br>Tired of sudden loud noises and things popping into your face? Rest assured, this game avoids such heart-stopping tactics.&lt;FUSHA2  Nocturnal Fishing<i>&gt; </i>is more like a classic horror film. It never relies on cheap jumpscares, yet masterfully maintains a deeply unsettling atmosphere that sends chills down your spine, fully committing to an immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105570/extras/8d3c39beeca2c523c2b1811c7439ffd0.avif?t=1764030755\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future Plans</strong> <br>While &lt;FUSHA2  Nocturnal Fishing<i>&gt;</i> is a complete story in itself, it also serves as the second chapter in the planned six-part &lt;<i>FUSHAS&gt;</i> saga. The hidden threads connecting the larger narrative are gradually being revealed. In future installments, we will continue to deliver uniquely styled horror stories, each offering a distinctively different experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recommendation</strong> <br>Ideal for players who enjoy text-based novels or horror, seeking a casual yet thrilling experience. Also makes for a unique gift for friends!</p>",
